      "Language": "eng",
      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "A case of a 70-year-old male with multiple medical complaints is presented. Pain is reported in 19 to 41% in cancer survivors six months to five years after the disease was cured, and 27 to 35% in survivors of five years or more. The epidemiology, causes and impact of this pain are discussed."},
